{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17741","headline":"寄昭应王丞 · 杨巨源","name":"寄昭应王丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武皇金辂辗香尘，每岁朝元及此辰。\n光动泉心初浴日，气蒸山腹总成春。\n讴歌已入云韶曲，词赋方归侍从臣。\n瑞霭朝朝犹望幸，天敎赤县有诗人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}